    <Positioned left="48" top="366" width="1104"><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="26" color="#111827">折扣在税前从货品小计扣除，运费不计税。</Text></Positioned>
    <Positioned left="48" top="432" width="1104"><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="26" color="#111827">税额以税前折后货品金额乘6%，四舍五入至分；最终应付再加运费。</Text></Positioned>
    <Positioned left="48" top="498" width="1104"><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="26" color="#111827">请核对订单编号、货品数量、单价与交付地址；任何修改应保留版本记录。</Text></Positioned>
    <Positioned left="48" top="560" width="1104" height="1"><Container color="#D1D5DB" /></Positioned>
